      "facts": [
        "Terminal capabilities and focus outlive a chat. Resetting these can re-enable animation while the app is still unfocused, and focus support would stay false because the mounted detector only reports support once per subscription.",
        "Node's child.kill() only terminates the direct process on Windows. Since the direct process is Git Bash, killing it first can orphan Bun/Node grandchildren before the later SIGKILL escalation has a tree to find. taskkill snapshots and force-terminates the complete descendant tree.",
        "Signal 0 checks for any remaining member without changing its state.",
        "Return the process IDs owned by in-flight terminal tools. Commands are started in their own process group on POSIX, where the group ID matches the child PID. No command text or environment is exposed: diagnostics are often pasted into bug reports and those values may contain secrets.",
        "The shell can exit while a grandchild ignores SIGTERM. Keep both the registry entry and escalation timer in that case so the process group is still visible to diagnostics and receives SIGKILL."
      ],
      "title": "New slash command /diagnostics",
      "summary": "New slash commands: `/diagnostics`. New files: `cli/src/commands/process-diagnostics.ts`.",
      "tags": [
        "commands",
        "new-files",
        "sdk",
        "cli"
      ],
      "day": "2026-07-13",
      "month": "2026-07",
      "category": "Commands",
      "significance": "notable",
      "hasDiff": true,
      "ai": {
        "model": "deepseek-v4.1",
        "v": 11,
        "calls": 2,
        "title": "/diagnostics command inspects CLI and terminal tool processes",
        "summary": "A new /diagnostics slash command (aliases diag, processes) appends a runtime diagnostics report to the chat via formatProcessDiagnostics(collectProcessDiagnostics()). The report shows CLI version, runtime, platform, uptime, CPU, memory, parent and CLI PIDs, the terminal watchdog state, and PIDs of in-flight terminal tool processes, while omitting command lines and environment variables for safety. Supporting exports getActiveTerminalCommandProcesses and ActiveTerminalCommandProcess were added to the SDK so the CLI can enumerate processes owned by in-flight terminal tools, and getTerminalWatchdogDiagnostics exposes the watchdog state. Process tracking in sdk/src/tools/run-terminal-command.ts now uses taskkill.exe to terminate the full descendant tree on Windows and delays removing a child from liveChildren until its process group is confirmed gone, so diagnostics still see orphaned grandchildren.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "end-users",
        "evidence": "New /diagnostics command handler in cli/src/commands/command-registry.ts invoking collectProcessDiagnostics and formatProcessDiagnostics from the new cli/src/commands/process-diagnostics.ts, registering it in cli/src/data/slash-commands.ts, and exposing getActiveTerminalCommandProcesses and ActiveTerminalCommandProcess from sdk/src/index.ts via sdk/src/tools/run-terminal-command.ts. The chat store reset in cli/src/state/chat-store.ts no longer restores inputFocused/isFocusSupported, and cli/src/utils/terminal-watchdog.ts adds getTerminalWatchdogDiagnostics. sdk/src/tools/run-terminal-command.ts adds taskkill.exe tree kills on Windows and keeps liveChildren tracked until the process group is gone.",
        "userVisible": true,
        "confidence": "high",
        "unknowns": "The rollout of the diagnostics report to non-Freebuff builds and any future surface that consumes getTerminalWatchdogDiagnostics or getActiveTerminalCommandProcesses beyond the CLI chat.",
        "changes": [
          {
            "area": "cli slash commands",
            "what": "Added /diagnostics command that prints a runtime diagnostics report into the chat, registered in the command registry and slash command list.",
            "files": [
              "cli/src/commands/command-registry.ts",
              "cli/src/data/slash-commands.ts"
            ]
          },
          {
            "area": "cli process diagnostics",
            "what": "Added new module collecting runtime, watchdog, and active terminal tool process information and formatting it into a human-readable report that excludes command lines and environment variables.",
            "files": [
              "cli/src/commands/process-diagnostics.ts"
            ]
          },
          {
            "area": "cli chat store",
            "what": "Reset now preserves terminal focus support and detected capabilities so a new chat does not re-enable animation while the app is still unfocused.",
            "files": [
              "cli/src/state/chat-store.ts"
            ]
          },
          {
            "area": "cli terminal watchdog",
            "what": "Added read-only diagnostics for the watchdog's armed, external, and pid state.",
            "files": [
              "cli/src/utils/terminal-watchdog.ts"
            ]
