        "title": "Add noGravityIndex flag to Base2 and GLM V52 to free agents",
        "summary": "Base2 agent gains `noGravityIndex` option to conditionally exclude the `gravity_index` tool and its system prompt directive. `FREEBUFF_GLM_V52_MODEL_ID` added to `FREE_MODE_AGENT_MODELS` in `common/src/constants/free-agents.ts`. Updates `agents/base2/base2.ts` to gate tool availability and prompt injection via the new flag.",
