      "eli5": {
        "text": "The assistant can now be told to skip its 'gravity index' tool and the reminder it keeps about using that tool, via a new yes/no setting added to how it is configured. One specific free model, identified as GLM V52, was also added to the list of models you can pick at no cost, so it now appears alongside the other free options when you choose a model. These changes are in place now: the tool is conditionally available depending on the new setting, and the new model is selectable today for anyone using the free tier. If you looked at the menu of free models, you would see the GLM V52 entry where it was missing before; and if the assistant is run with the new setting turned on, it simply won't have the gravity_index tool or its built-in reminder about it at all.",
