        "title": "Referral banner moves inside model selector, drops focus store",
        "summary": "The referral banner is now rendered inside the model selector's scrollbox content box, so the parent landing screen no longer reserves viewport rows for it and only fixed status lines below the selector reduce its height. Keyboard focus between the model rows and the banner's copy/GLM buttons is coordinated via a local `FreebuffReferralFocusTarget[]` and the selector's existing `focusedId`, replacing the deleted `useFreebuffLandingFocusStore` Zustand bridge. The selector measures its real laid-out height through `onSizeChange` on a content ref instead of a hand-computed row budget, so wrapped referral copy and responsive action rows no longer desync the auto-scroll math.",
